<section class="section" aria-label="Privacy policy">
  <div class="container prose">
    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p>Marvin David Delgado (MarvinApps), Bogotá, Colombia. WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/573214012236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+57 321 401 2236</a>. This policy follows Colombian Law 1581 of 2012 and Decree 1377 of 2013.</p>
    <h2>What data I receive and why</h2>
    <p>This site has no database and does not store what you type on any server. The contact form only builds a message and opens WhatsApp on your device; you decide whether to send it. When you write to me on WhatsApp or LinkedIn, I receive the data you share (name, company, phone and your message) and use it only to reply, prepare a proposal and follow up on your request. I do not sell it or share it with third parties for marketing.</p>
    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Messages sent through WhatsApp or LinkedIn are also subject to those services’ privacy policies. The hosting provider may log technical access data (such as IP address and browser) for security.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
    <p>I don’t use cookies, analytics or ads. The site only stores your theme (light or dark) and language preference in your browser; you can clear it from your browser settings.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can access, update, correct or request deletion of your data, and withdraw your consent, by messaging me on WhatsApp at the number above. I answer requests within 10 business days and complaints within 15 business days. If you are not satisfied, you can contact Colombia’s Superintendencia de Industria y Comercio.</p>
    <h2>Retention and changes</h2>
    <p>I keep your data while our business relationship lasts or until you ask me to delete it. If this policy changes, I will publish the new version on this page.</p>
  </div>
